### `CHANGELOG.md`

```markdown
# Changelog

All notable changes to the **Edu-Motherwell Development Organisation** web project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https.keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/), and this project adheres to Semantic Versioning (`v1.0.0`).

---

## [1.2.0] - 2026-09-15

### Added
* Integrated a modern 2-card feature layout on `index.html` combining key text highlights with structured image banners.
* Redesigned `about.html` into a modern 3-card grid layout highlighting **Brief History**, **Mission Statement**, and **Vision Statement** with visual badge icons.

### Changed
* Refactored global form styles in `style.css` to ensure all input labels, headers, and legends render in high-contrast explicit black text (`#000000`).
* Improved responsive breakpoint handling for tablet and desktop views across all primary pages.

### Fixed
* Fixed broken HTML document structures, misplaced closing tags (`</main>`, `</form>`), and improper viewport meta tag syntax across subpages.
* Corrected element ID mismatches in input `label[for]` attributes on `enquiry.html`.
* Placed `<footer>` elements inside valid `<body>` parent containers across all pages.

---

## [1.1.0] - 2026-09-10

### Added
* Integrated interactive Enquiry Page (`enquiry.html`) with form fieldsets for Personal Information, Location, Enquiry Category, Availability, and Specific Request fields.
* Added standard site header, logo containers, and responsive site navigation bar across all subpages.

### Changed
* Separated internal `<style>` block declarations from HTML documents into external stylesheet `css/style.css`.

---

## [1.0.0] - 2026-08-28

### Added
* Initial project setup and core file structure creation.
* Basic semantic HTML structure for `index.html`, `about.html`, `services.html`, and `contactus.html`.
* Integrated shared organizational footer containing contact details, quick links, and social media links.